      "content": "it's hard to reach out when there's nobody to reach out to. i've tried. i go to coffee shops, i go to work, i try to be polite... but it's like i'm shouting into a void. it just makes me feel more exhausted. like i'm just taking up space that could be used by someone who actually matters.",
